WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.497
In thirteenth-century Cairo, a medicine had to

00:00:03.497 --> 00:00:06.194
remain useful after the fire went out.

00:00:06.194 --> 00:00:08.891
That was a problem of process, material

00:00:08.891 --> 00:00:10.047
judgment, and trust.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.663
A pharmacist's handbook composed in Cairo in

00:00:18.663 --> 00:00:21.525
twelve sixty sets out practical rules. The

00:00:21.525 --> 00:00:24.388
manuscript pictured here is a later Egyptian

00:00:24.388 --> 00:00:26.433
copy, dated nineteen oh four.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.088
Its rose-water and sugar base could become

00:00:34.088 --> 00:00:37.376
many different syrups. Fruit or medicinal material

00:00:37.376 --> 00:00:40.664
supplied the distinguishing form. The handbook describes

00:00:40.664 --> 00:00:42.543
this material relationship explicitly.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.577
Preparation demanded more than mixing. Sugar was

00:00:48.577 --> 00:00:51.353
dissolved, foam was removed, the liquid passed

00:00:51.353 --> 00:00:54.130
through cloth, and the vessel returned to

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:56.113
the fire for further concentration.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.936
A recognized consistency was the endpoint, not

00:01:03.936 --> 00:01:07.071
a numerical reading. Too little control risked

00:01:07.071 --> 00:01:10.207
spoilage. Pushing concentration too far could make

00:01:10.207 --> 00:01:11.551
a syrup crystallize.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.668
The handbook also described failure. Sugared syrup

00:01:18.668 --> 00:01:21.536
could be dissolved with warm water, brought

00:01:21.536 --> 00:01:24.405
back toward its intended consistency, and adjusted

00:01:24.405 --> 00:01:25.634
with fruit water.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.749
Scarcity raised another problem. The appropriate substitute

00:01:33.749 --> 00:01:36.699
had to be judged by function and

00:01:36.699 --> 00:01:39.648
preparation, not simply appearance. Deliberate adulteration posed

00:01:39.648 --> 00:01:41.755
a different kind of risk.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:49.257
Cairo Genizah prescriptions illuminate the distance between

00:01:49.257 --> 00:01:52.713
written demand and available supply. Reliability was

00:01:52.713 --> 00:01:56.170
achieved through practical judgment, not through a

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:59.133
medieval version of modern drug regulation.
